Software Engineer, Rapid Response Assignment  - UK &lt;h1&gt;Software Engineer, Rapid Response Assignment - (UK)&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Cheltenham, UK (Remote)&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Product &amp;amp; Engineering&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-Time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About VulnCheck&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Exploitation prevention is only as strong as the intelligence driving those efforts, and most of the industry is still running on intelligence that lacks exploit context. VulnCheck, The Exploit Intelligence Company, delivers structured exploit intelligence on what is actively weaponized in the wild, purpose-built for the data lakes, ETL pipelines, automation, and AI and LLM workflows your infrastructure already runs on, raising the capability of everything it powers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Software Engineer, Rapid Response Assignment who combines strong engineering skills with a deep commitment to customer outcomes. In this hands-on role, you&#39;ll make sure our customers stay unblocked and that the issues they raise are resolved quickly, accurately, and for good.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll diagnose and fix complex problems across our platform, deliver improvements that directly address customer needs, and work closely with our Customer Success team to turn technical challenges into great outcomes. As part of a global engineering team providing continuous coverage, you&#39;ll bring engineering rigor to the work that customers feel most directly. This is a 100% remote role, but we&#39;re primarily looking for candidates based in Cheltenham, UK.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolve customer-reported issues quickly and thoroughly, from investigation through to a durable fix&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose complex, ambiguous problems across our services and data pipelines, tracing them to root cause&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver high-quality engineering work that improves the platform and directly addresses customer needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Customer Success to align on technical solutions and outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and improve backend systems, APIs, and data pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write high-quality, maintainable code and uphold engineering best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve system reliability, performance, and observability across the platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in incident response and on-call rotations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience building and scaling backend systems as a software engineer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming skills in one or more languages (Python, Go, Java, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong diagnostic and debugging skills, with a proven ability to root-cause complex production issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity and persistence — a drive to understand problems fully and see them through to resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A customer-obsessed mindset: you take pride in delivering accurate, high-quality solutions that delight customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, with the ability to work effectively with customers and cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of distributed systems, microservices, APIs, system design, and cloud infrastructure (AWS preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with data pipelines, ETL systems, or high-volume data processing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in a customer reliability, sustaining, support, or escalation engineering role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in cybersecurity, vulnerability management, or threat intelligence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CVE, NVD, KEV, or exploit intelligence datasets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with streaming systems or real-time data processing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in high-growth or startup environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe people do their best work when they feel supported, trusted, and valued. VulnCheck offers benefits designed to meet a wide range of needs and lifestyles, tailored to your country of employment:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous, flexible time off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement/pension plan contributions (e.g., 401k with match in the US; local pension schemes elsewhere)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive healthcare coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous paid parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote-friendly environment with flexibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support for home office costs (phone &amp;amp; internet)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ongoing professional development, coaching, and learning resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities for career advancement within a fast-growing team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Specific benefit details vary by country and are confirmed during the offer process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built on over two decades of cybersecurity experience, our team of experts understands the intricacies of vulnerabilities, their exploitation in the wild, and how to leverage this data to build more effective cybersecurity products that produce better outcomes for organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VulnCheck gives organizations a tactical advantage by providing best-in-class exploit &amp;amp; vulnerability intelligence information. We have a sense of duty to protect the critical infrastructure we rely on including medical devices, power grids and telecommunication networks. We were founded in 2021 in Lexington, Massachusetts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VulnCheck has a transparent, collaborative, and supportive culture - we are looking for people who have a growth mindset, are curious and innovative. Our team is smart, but humble, hardworking, and supportive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VulnCheck is proud to be an Equal Employer Opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or other applicable legally protected characteristics. VulnCheck is committed to working with and providing reasonable accommodations to applicants with physical and mental disabilities. *Even if your experience doesn’t perfectly align with the job description, we encourage you to apply—we value potential just as much as a perfect resume.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Engineering  Cheltenham

Senior User Research Manager &lt;p&gt;📍London/Cardiff/UK Remote | 💰£110,000-£150,000 + equity + Incentive Awards tied to your performance + &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; ✨&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team⭐&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Core Banking&#39;s mission is to make everyday money magical for everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re responsible for the products millions of customers rely on every day — from current accounts, joint accounts and accounts for kids and teens, through to money management, budgeting, and our paid subscriptions. These are some of Monzo&#39;s most loved experiences, and they&#39;re at the heart of how customers interact with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we continue to grow, we&#39;re looking for a Senior User Research Manager to help shape the future of Personal Banking. This is an opportunity to lead research across one of Monzo&#39;s largest product areas, influence company strategy, and develop exceptional research leaders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔑You’ll play a key role by...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be responsible for both people leadership and strategic research leadership. This includes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading research across Core Banking while helping shape a coherent Personal Banking research strategy that spans multiple product areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering closely with the Core Banking Leadership Team, Product Directors, Design leaders and senior stakeholders across Wealth, Payments, Borrowing and our European business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Helping define and land parts of Monzo&#39;s global research operating model as we expand internationally, ensuring teams work effectively across both global and local markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connecting customer insights across collectives, identifying themes, opportunities and gaps rather than viewing research through the lens of a single team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bringing together existing research, product data, market insights and quantitative evidence to help leadership make informed strategic decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing managers and supporting approximately 6-8 direct and indirect reports while maintaining a consistently high bar for research quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creating an environment where researchers can balance methodological rigour with the speed needed to build great products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤩 We’d love to hear from you if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have experience with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading senior researchers and/or research managers within a complex product organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shaping and influencing product strategy through research at both organisational and executive level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working across multiple product areas, bringing together disparate customer insights into a coherent strategic narrative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigating complex stakeholder environments where different teams have competing priorities, metrics and timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering with Product, Design, Engineering and Data Science leaders to influence roadmaps and business strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Combining qualitative research with quantitative signals, product data and market insights to develop strategic recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building alignment across large organisations and landing new ways of working with multidisciplinary teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coaching research leaders while maintaining a high quality bar across multiple teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Making thoughtful trade-offs between research depth, pace and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🙌 What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 £110,000 - £150,000 ➕ Incentive Awards tied to your performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✈️ We’ll help you relocate to the UK.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✅ We can sponsor your visa.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍This role can be based in our London office, but we&#39;re open to distributed working within the UK (with ad hoc meetings in London)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⏰ We offer flexible working hours and trust you to work enough hours to do your job well, and at times that suit you and your team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 £1,000 learning budget each year to use on books, training courses and conferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏡 We will set you up to work from home; all employees are given Macbooks and for fully remote workers we will provide extra support for your work-from-home setup.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➕ Plus lots more! &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;Read our full list of benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌈&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; The application journey has 3 key steps&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruiter call (30 minutes):&lt;/strong&gt; A conversation with one of our recruiters to learn more about your background, motivations, and what you&#39;re looking for next, while giving you the opportunity to learn more about Monzo and the role.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Ways of Working (45 minutes):&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;ll explore your leadership experience, approach to research strategy, and how you raise the research quality bar.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Final loop (Total 1hr 30 - 2 hours):&lt;/strong&gt; Two interviews covering &lt;strong&gt;Managing Teams &amp;amp; People&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Impact&lt;/strong&gt;, where we&#39;ll discuss your approach to developing research leaders, building high-performing teams, influencing strategy, and driving organisational impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This process should take around 3-4 weeks - your schedule is really important to us, so we promise to be as flexible as possible!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have some guidelines on using Artificial Intelligence (AI) to ace an application and interview at Monzo. &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/the-ultimate-guide-on-using-ai-to-ace-an-interview-at-monzo&quot;&gt;You can read them here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
