&lt;li&gt;Undertake any duties as may be required from time to time that can reasonably be regarded as within the remit of the post.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aware of and conform to legal requirements in all activities, both internal and external. Implicit in this is that all managers and employees conform to the appropriate standards in terms of Data Protection, Health and Safety and Information Security requirements but also to the highest standards of business ethics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
