&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Practical GenAI experience: LLM integration, prompt engineering, RAG architectures, and agentic workflows for automating knowledge-intensive processes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
